telliteImages {I₁, I₂, ..., Iₜ}, SpatialVars, HistoricalLULC, α ∈[0,1], T' 
Output: LULC_pred, Uncertainty 
Begin 
// 1. Preprocess Data 
//Normalise radiometric values, rasterise inputs, and stack 
// multi-temporal images into temporal sequences 
For t = 1 to T :
It←Normalize (Standardize(Rasterize(It)))
// 2. CNN Feature Extraction 
// Extract spatial feature maps F_t from each image I_t 
// using convolution and ReLU layers 
For t = 1 to T :
F = CNN(It)
where CNN(It) = σ(Wk ∗It +bk) for layers k=1..K (convolution + ReLU) 
// 3.

ot = σ(Wo⋅[ht−1, xt] +bo) // Output gate 
ht = ot ∗tanh(Ct) // Hidden state 
DLpred = hT // Final DL prediction 
// 4. Traditional Prediction 
// Generate CA–ANN based prediction using transition matrix 
// and spatial suitability weights 
P = Transition Matrix (Historical) // Markov chain 
S = Spatial Weights (Spatial Vars) //logistic regression 
Trad_pred = P × S // Matrix multiplication 
// 5. Ensemble Integration 
// Fuse DL and CA–ANN predictions using weighted averaging 
LULC_pred = α ⋅ DL_pred + (1-α) ⋅ Trad_pred 
